# DSC-02 Computer System Architecture - CPU Sim Practicals

**Tool:** CPU Sim 4.0.11 - Mano's Basic Computer (BasicComputer.cpu)
**Language:** Assembly

### Practical List
1. Create a Machine
2. Create Fetch Routine
3. ADD Operation
4. SUBTRACT Operation
5. Logical Operations (AND, OR, NOT, XOR, NOR, NAND)
6. Memory-reference (ADD, LDA, STA, BUN, ISZ)
7. Register-reference (CLA, CMA, CME, HLT)
8. Register-reference (INC, SPA, SNA, SZE)
9. Register-reference (CIR, CIL)
10. Sum until Negative
11. Sum until Zero

### How to Run
Open BasicComputer.cpu in CPU Sim -> Open .a program -> Ctrl+2 Assemble & Load -> Ctrl+R Run

### Files
- machine/BasicComputer.cpu - Main machine
- programs/ - All .a assembly files
- screenshots/ - Output screenshots
